{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:15 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>周日意甲科木主場 0:0守和羅馬，科木的意大利國腳森梅利列斯（Samuele Ricci）全場在後備席坐冷板凳，被其在體育頻道 DAZN的36 歲女友「意甲女神」Eleonora Incardona完全搶去風頭。Eleonora Incardona以性感透視裝現身場邊報道，大受球迷和網民歡迎。</p>\n<img alt=\"科木主場 0:0守和羅馬。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/794a5932ddce5a69d3dfad0796412a6b/2026-10/AFP_D2WE8M2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木主場 0:0守和羅馬。美聯社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d05ed5af3c3984b7ae0f4d82dd793ddd/2026-10/Italy_Serie_A_Soccer_14_79--47d3c.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯全場坐冷板 女友透視裝場邊報導搶盡風頭。Eleonora Incardona Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ec7f5c2e41020f026fb092870f07d92/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Eleonora 的男友森梅利列斯全場在後備席坐冷板凳。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6781451ab98ebe0648dce2f1deb7976/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_44_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db7a574a6226f7576c343a70813a6ae5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/418bee15df5446f4241ced6f6b9cd31b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_46_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17a0005b96cc611a6a6f3c074e482305/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_46_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53f43aecdf48391627ff28edf5861c01/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM_5_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ca096aec8ed24581916ef3fc2b8e50c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e7e14ca89393235aa6d8aaca2003c8d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1384e9c924ee975d2e1841fbb141ee6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c785aef4f06a5876a32de61cb89cd8a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_45_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49c6a284a4e0330e7c59883695ad30c6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_44_PM_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/297db79adb60b63fadb276c5b89e1b64/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_44_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/699cbf3c440b3efc1b186f8332fae02f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_44_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d0a6bd4c1abafdaace6937b9a33c1e6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_44_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木中場森梅利列斯與女友Eleonora Incardona。Eleonora Instagram圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3a937bebb57677716c378e6e6c47fbc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_6_40_43_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"科木主場 0:0守和羅馬。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ced77f4be926dbdbd715b379953c807a/2026-10/AFP_D2WH3G4.jpg\"/>\n<h2>科木對羅馬悶和完場</h2>\n<p>意甲聯賽第六輪科木主場迎戰羅馬，實力較高的羅馬全場佔得較多攻勢，直至 53分鐘羅馬前鋒馬倫（Donyell Malen）因一次的粗野鏟球被裁判直接出示紅牌罰下，羅馬被逼十人應戰下攻勢才放緩。最終雙方互無紀錄和氣收場。</p>\n<h2>DAZN女主播成比賽焦點</h2>\n<p>被譽為「意甲女神」的 Eleonora 一向深受意大利以至全球球迷喜愛，周日她現身球場為體育串流平台 DAZN 進行賽事報道。她的一身極度吸睛的性感透視上衣驚艷全場，她的一舉手一投足都吸引球迷的目光，甚至比起沉悶的球賽更加精彩，賽後亦在網上引起球迷熱烈討論。</p>\n<p>反觀，Eleonora 的男友森梅利列斯，被科木主帥法比加斯（Cesc Fabregas）安排屈居後備，未獲派上陣一展身手，被Eleonora搶盡風頭。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:39:06.923412+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":512,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:15:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T00:38:04.718093+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:37:48.086761+00:00","content_hash":"1470cd48fed97c8f5de8468b784f045ab5d8395352148e2bc495fc49ba374c48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}